  "notes": "candidate=1, unmeasured. S048 Combined Arms / Established Base. S026 BA supplies bases, stagings, economy, service, supply, spawn/rally pads, the 14 field instance pads and MainHighway. S019 CE supplies objective roles, explicit convoy/defense pad sizes, structure footprints and pad slack. S043 area-measurement-r1.json found ConvoyDestination inside playable at 1116 m2 and all five CE pads fit as-is. ConvoyDestination uses S027 air.enemy and S026 candidate.rally.variant0.faction_2. Convoy origins 1/2/3 use S027 Standard structure anchors 0/8/6, and defense approaches a/b use S027 service.enemy and candidate.structure.standard.7. FlankNorthRuins follows the W7 S031 r2 chain, replacing west_refined 06/07 in the route with S026 dump candidate 274 and S026 primary waypoint 04. FlankSouthSweep follows the W7 S031 r2 chain from S026 tank.start through dump candidates 303/393/398/279/371/360/357 in order to S026 tank.goal. Dump indices are zero-based in Design/AgentReports/SkirmishExpansion/LayoutDumps/S026/dump.json. S031-area-measurement-r2.json records all three chains on S026. Native measurement of this revised CE draft is pending. S030 BA supplies both approach watchtowers, satellite dishes, helipad instance pads and their anchors. War/LargeWar refinery module positions are unmeasured and left to derived pads. Airport positions are unmeasured for both sides and no Airport instance is granted at start.",
